{"id":"6e0a062a6861b59d","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-mm-unification-measure.md","title":"合一目标的终止三元组","display":"df-mm-unification-measure — 合一目标的终止三元组","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-mm-unification-measure","aliases":["56-df-mm-unification-measure"],"display":"df-mm-unification-measure — 合一目标的终止三元组","depends_on":["[[56-df-unification-problem]]","[[56-df-collapsing-duplicating]]"],"source_section":"§7.7 proof of Theorem 7.7.6","source_printed_pages":"293","source_ocr_blocks":[314],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-mm-unification-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-mm-unification-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mm-unification-measure — 合一目标的终止三元组"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8198395909603c44\" href=\"?note=8198395909603c44\" title=\"56-df-unification-problem\">56-df-unification-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8133fc32a2cf7026\" href=\"?note=8133fc32a2cf7026\" title=\"56-df-collapsing-duplicating\">56-df-collapsing-duplicating</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§7.7 proof of Theorem 7.7.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"293"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>314</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in\\mathcal G\">\\(E\\in\\mathcal G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Vars}\">\\(\\operatorname{Vars}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8198395909603c44\" href=\"?note=8198395909603c44\" title=\"56-df-unification-problem\">56-df-unification-problem</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{occ}_x\">\\(\\operatorname{occ}_x\\)</span> 复用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8133fc32a2cf7026\" href=\"?note=8133fc32a2cf7026\" title=\"56-df-collapsing-duplicating\">56-df-collapsing-duplicating</a> 的有限位置计数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(g\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=\\operatorname{ar}(g)\">\\(k=\\operatorname{ar}(g)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1,\\ldots,t_k\\in T\">\\(t_1,\\ldots,t_k\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fun}:T\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{fun}:T\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 通过自由有限项结构递归定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,f,l:\\mathcal G\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(u,f,l:\\mathcal G\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为以下定义的三个目标测度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fun}(y)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\operatorname{fun}(g(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{i=1}^{k}\\operatorname{fun}(t_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fun}(y)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\operatorname{fun}(g(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{i=1}^{k}\\operatorname{fun}(t_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SolvedVars}(E)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{Vars}(E)\\mid\\exists t\\in T\\;((x,t)\\in E)\\land\\sum_{(s,u)\\in E}(\\operatorname{occ}_x(s)+\\operatorname{occ}_x(u))=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SolvedVars}(E)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{Vars}(E)\\mid\\exists t\\in T\\;((x,t)\\in E)\\land\\sum_{(s,u)\\in E}(\\operatorname{occ}_x(s)+\\operatorname{occ}_x(u))=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u(E)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{Vars}(E)\\setminus\\operatorname{SolvedVars}(E)|,\\quad f(E)\\coloneqq\\sum_{(s,t)\\in E}\\operatorname{fun}(s),\\quad l(E)\\coloneqq|E|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u(E)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{Vars}(E)\\setminus\\operatorname{SolvedVars}(E)|,\\quad f(E)\\coloneqq\\sum_{(s,t)\\in E}\\operatorname{fun}(s),\\quad l(E)\\coloneqq|E|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu(E)\\coloneqq(u(E),f(E),l(E)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu(E)\\coloneqq(u(E),f(E),l(E)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol a&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex3}}\\boldsymbol b\\iff a_1&lt;b_1\\lor(a_1=b_1\\land a_2&lt;b_2)\\lor(a_1=b_1\\land a_2=b_2\\land a_3&lt;b_3)\\quad(\\boldsymbol a,\\boldsymbol b\\in\\mathbb N^3).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\boldsymbol a&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex3}}\\boldsymbol b\\iff a_1&lt;b_1\\lor(a_1=b_1\\land a_2&lt;b_2)\\lor(a_1=b_1\\land a_2=b_2\\land a_3&lt;b_3)\\quad(\\boldsymbol a,\\boldsymbol b\\in\\mathbb N^3).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用原书的三元组：未解变量数、方程左边函数符号总出现次数、目标方程数；f并非所有项的总大小。已解变量须在整个目标中恰出现一次且在某方程左边独占该边。occ复用本目录既有的变量出现次数定义，避免重复引入同一符号；fun的结构递归唯一，E有限使所有和与计数为自然数。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，本轮重新提取文字层后比对上述章节。OCR 页块以 U+001F 分段从1计数，不等同于 DjVu 物理扫描页；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-unification-problem","status":"resolved","id":"8198395909603c44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-unification-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-collapsing-duplicating","status":"resolved","id":"8133fc32a2cf7026","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-collapsing-duplicating]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-unification-problem","status":"resolved","id":"8198395909603c44","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\in\\mathcal G$，$T$ 与 $\\operatorname{Vars}$ 见 [[56-df-unification-problem]]。$x,y\\in\\mathcal V$，$\\operatorname{occ}_x$ 复用 [[56-df-collapsing-duplicating]] 的有限位置计数；$g\\in\\mathcal F$，$k=\\operatorname{ar}(g)$，$t_1,\\ldots,t_k\\in T$；$\\operatorname{fun}:T\\to\\mathbb N$ 通过自由有限项结构递归定义。$u,f,l:\\mathcal G\\to\\mathbb N$ 为以下定义的三个目标测度。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-collapsing-duplicating","status":"resolved","id":"8133fc32a2cf7026","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\in\\mathcal G$，$T$ 与 $\\operatorname{Vars}$ 见 [[56-df-unification-problem]]。$x,y\\in\\mathcal V$，$\\operatorname{occ}_x$ 复用 [[56-df-collapsing-duplicating]] 的有限位置计数；$g\\in\\mathcal F$，$k=\\operatorname{ar}(g)$，$t_1,\\ldots,t_k\\in T$；$\\operatorname{fun}:T\\to\\mathbb N$ 通过自由有限项结构递归定义。$u,f,l:\\mathcal G\\to\\mathbb N$ 为以下定义的三个目标测度。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E\\in\\mathcal G","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Vars}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{occ}_x","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"k=\\operatorname{ar}(g)","display":false},{"tex":"t_1,\\ldots,t_k\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fun}:T\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"u,f,l:\\mathcal G\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fun}(y)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\operatorname{fun}(g(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{i=1}^{k}\\operatorname{fun}(t_i).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SolvedVars}(E)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{Vars}(E)\\mid\\exists t\\in T\\;((x,t)\\in E)\\land\\sum_{(s,u)\\in E}(\\operatorname{occ}_x(s)+\\operatorname{occ}_x(u))=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"u(E)\\coloneqq|\\operatorname{Vars}(E)\\setminus\\operatorname{SolvedVars}(E)|,\\quad f(E)\\coloneqq\\sum_{(s,t)\\in E}\\operatorname{fun}(s),\\quad l(E)\\coloneqq|E|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu(E)\\coloneqq(u(E),f(E),l(E)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol a<_{\\mathrm{lex3}}\\boldsymbol b\\iff a_1<b_1\\lor(a_1=b_1\\land a_2<b_2)\\lor(a_1=b_1\\land a_2=b_2\\land a_3<b_3)\\quad(\\boldsymbol a,\\boldsymbol b\\in\\mathbb N^3).","display":true}],"bytes":2314,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-mm-unification-measure.md]]"},{"id":"bc72c7a211eea473","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal G,S,\\mathcal G_\\bot$ 与合一步骤见 [[56-df-mm-unification-step]]，$\\mu,<_{\\mathrm{lex3}}$ 见 [[56-df-mm-unification-measure]]，有限极大运行见 [[56-df-mm-unification-run]]。"}],"outgoing":["8198395909603c44","8133fc32a2cf7026"]}